@startuml Review_Topic_Proposal
title Activity Diagram - Review Topic Proposal (Approve/Reject/Request Revision)

|Instructor|
start
:View pending proposal details;
:Review project documents;
if (Decision?) then (Approve)
  :Select "Approve";
elseif (Needs changes) then
  :Select "Request Revision";
  :Enter review comment;
else (Reject)
  :Select "Reject";
  :Enter review comment;
endif

:Click "Submit Review";

|Web Application|
:Validate request body;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send review decision\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Extract instructorId\nfrom JWT token;
:Call TopicProposalService.\nReviewProposalAsync(instructorId, submissionId, request);
:Get submission with details;
if (Submission not found?) then (yes)
  :Return 404 Not Found;
  stop
endif

:Check if instructor owns class;
if (Unauthorized?) then (yes)
  :Return 403 Forbidden;
  stop
endif

:Create ProjectApprovalHistory record:\n- SubmissionId\n- ReviewerId (instructorId)\n- Action (Approved/Rejected/Revision)\n- Comment\n- ActedAt;

if (ReviewStatus == "Approved"?) then (yes)
  :Update Project status to "Approved";
endif

:Save changes to database;
:Return TopicProposalReviewResponseDto;
:Send 200 OK response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Remove proposal from pending list;
  :Send notification to student group;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View review confirmation;
stop
@enduml

